WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:03.500
Turn one point into
a fifty-meter area.

00:03.650 --> 00:06.950
In Map Nero, select your point
and open Buffer.

00:07.050 --> 00:09.050
Enter fifty, and choose meters.

00:09.150 --> 00:12.600
Pick a color and opacity,
then create the buffer.

00:12.650 --> 00:15.000
Your original point
stays unchanged.

00:15.000 --> 00:16.850
Available with Pro or Team.

00:16.850 --> 00:18.900
Map Nero dot com.
